{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expose","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Public because §20 hands the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"requesting party’s","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" token to the calling application: an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"RPT exists to be sent onward on the retried request, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":"UmaRequestingPartyToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" could never be read would make the whole ticket grant unusable. The same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applies to a PAT an application obtained elsewhere and now has to hand to the Protection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API. Widening from module-internal is additive and breaks no existing caller.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this only at the point of actually using the value"}]},{"text":" — attaching it to an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Authorization"},{"text":" header, writing it to your own encrypted store — and never pass the result","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a log, trace, or serialisation sink. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/description","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/debugDescription","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"itself still always redact, but that protection does not follow the raw value once this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method returns it.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"expose"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"}],"title":"expose()","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV6exposexyF"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/expose()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the protected value — this SDK’s single explicit accessor (§7 rule 3).","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/sensitive\/expose()"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/Sensitive/description":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"description"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"title":"description","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/sensitive\/description","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive\/description"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/Sensitive/expose()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the protected value — this SDK’s single explicit accessor (§7 rule 3)."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind"